t there. https://t.co/dgGHSnna3S","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":1,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[{"url":"https://t.co/dgGHSnna3S","expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ashishkjha/status/1248044751930028032","display_url":"twitter.com/ashishkjha/sta…","indices":[168,191]}],"hashtags":[],"media":[]},"media":[]},{"id":"1248106268885053445","created_at":"Thu Apr 09 04:31:37 +0000 2020","timestamp":"2020-04-09T04:31:37.000Z","full_text":"Talked wife this morning about the survival rates on ventilators being really low &amp; that if one of use gets hospitalization level  #covid19 we need to say our goodbyes before hand, just in case.\n\nHospitalization does not automatically mean vent, but visits will be unlikely.","is_retweet":false,"favorite_count":2,"retweet_count":0,"lang":"en","entities":{"user_mentions":[],"urls":[],"hashtags":[{"text":"covid19","indices":[135,143]}],"media":[]},"media":[]}]